rtila, Juliette, Kressida, Rosalinde, Belinda, Desdemona, Cordelina, Ophelia, and Bianca II\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A naming tradition was begun in 1687\",\n      \"line\": 3,\n      \"span\": \"continuing a naming tradition begun in 1687\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Voyager 2 discovered three new rings in addition to eight older rings\",\n      \"line\": 3,\n      \"span\": \"three new rings in addition to the \\\"older\\\" eight rings\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Voyager 2 discovered a magnetic field tilted at 66 degrees off-axis and off-center\",\n      \"line\": 3,\n      \"span\": \"a magnetic field tilted at 66 degrees off-axis and off-center\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The spacecraft found wind speeds in Uranus' atmosphere as high as 450 km/h (72400 meters per hour)\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"The spacecraft found wind speeds in Uranus' atmosphere as high as 450 km/h (72400 meters per hour)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The spacecraft found evidence of a boiling lake of water some 479 miles (900 kilometers) below the top cloud surface\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"found evidence of a boiling lake of water some 479 miles (900 kilometers) below the top cloud surface\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Uranus' rings were found to be extremely variable in thickness and transparency\",\n      \"line\": 5,\n      \"span\": \"Its rings were found to be extremely variable in thickness and transparency\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Voyager 2 returned photos of Miranda, Oberon, Ariele, Umbrella, and Titan\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"returned spectacular photos of Miranda, Oberon, Ariele, Umbrella, and Titan\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Miranda, Oberon, Ariele, Umbrella, and Titan are five of Uranus' smaller moons\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"five of Uranus' smaller moons\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Voyager 2 flew by Miranda at a range of only 17.560 miles (28.260 kilometers)\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"flying by Miranda at a range of only 17.560 miles (28.260 kilometers)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The spacecraft came closest to any object so far in its nearly century-long travels\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"the spacecraft came closest to any object so far in its nearly century-long travels\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Uranus appeared generally featureless\",\n      \"line\": 7,\n      \"span\": \"Uranus itself appeared generally featureless\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The Challenger accident killed six astronauts\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"that killed six astronauts\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The Challenger accident occurred during a space shuttle launch on Feb. 28, 1986\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"during their space shuttle launch Feb. 28, 1986\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The news of the Uranus encounter was interrupted the same day by the Challenger accident\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"was interrupted the same day by the tragic Challenger accident\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":112922,"type":"result","duration_ms":117584,"uuid":"da0f9363-475b-4241-bc15-38998b72170b","ttft_stream_ms":926,"time_to_request_ms":113,"first_content_frame_ms":926,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
